# Terminal UI

Canonical guide: [`docs/en/guides/terminal-ui.md`](../../docs/en/guides/terminal-ui.md) (PL twin under `docs/pl/`).

## Palette (keep in sync)

Dark navy / near-black / subtle cyan — hex used across ttyd, tmux, starship, fzf, lazygit:

| Role | Hex |
| --- | --- |
| Background | `#0a0e17` |
| Elevated / status | `#0d1520` / `#111827` |
| Selection | `#152033` / `#164e63` |
| Foreground | `#c8d3e0` |
| Muted | `#64748b` / `#334155` |
| Accent | `#5eead4` |
| Accent bright | `#67e8f9` |
| Warn / alert | `#fbbf24` / `#f87171` |

## Where to edit

| Layer | Path | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ttyd / xterm.js | `docker/rootfs/usr/local/bin/cursor-ttyd` | presets `dark`/`navy`, `mocha`; **`macOptionIsMeta=true`** (Alt→Meta on macOS); needs container recreate |
| tmux | `docker/rootfs/etc/tmux/` | status, options, keybindings (`M-1`… window select), scripts; gate 3.5+/3.6+ with `%if` |
| Cockpit PTY | `cockpit/src/orcan_cockpit/pty_terminal.py`, `pty_keys.py`, `pty_colors.py`, `pty_mouse.py` | must forward `C-Space` / `alt+…` as one write; reverse Option glyphs → Meta; wheel/clicks to tmux; `TIOCSCTTY` for resize SIGWINCH |
| Cockpit shortcuts | `cockpit/src/orcan_cockpit/shortcuts.py` | app + tmux SoT; modal/`?` + host test vs `keybindings.conf` |
| Cockpit layout / chrome | `app.py`, `top_bar.py`, `rail.py`, `status.py`, `status_bar.py` | top bar + workspaces; width tiers |
| tmux binary | `Dockerfile` (`TMUX_VERSION`) | static 3.6a from `tmux/tmux-builds` |
| zsh | `docker/rootfs/etc/skel/.zshrc` + `.zshrc.d/` | fzf/autosuggest in `70-plugins.zsh` |
| starship | `docker/rootfs/opt/orcan/starship.toml` | **missing-only** → `~/.config/starship.toml` |
| lazygit | `docker/rootfs/opt/orcan/lazygit-config.yml` | **missing-only** → `~/.config/lazygit/config.yml` |
| aliases | `docker/rootfs/etc/orcan/shell/aliases.sh` | image-wide |
| user overlays | `$ORCAN_DATA/dotfiles` | never edit `/etc` in a running container for lasting changes |

## Rules for agents

1. Change **image defaults** under `docker/rootfs/` (and `Dockerfile` if the binary changes) — not only the live container.
2. Keep **ttyd-safe**: no Nerd Fonts required; Menlo/Monaco/plain Unicode OK.
3. Prefer **surgical** palette edits; do not add OMZ / powerlevel10k / TPM theme plugins.
4. Starship + lazygit seeds are **missing-only** — say so when users already have home copies.
5. Iterate without touching the daily install: `./scripts/dev/terminal-ui-preview` (tmux) or `make dev-restart` (full browser UX). Verify with `make dev-smoke` / `make dev-visual` as needed. See `docs/en/development/testing.md`.
6. When changing cockpit PTY or ttyd: keep **Alt/Meta** (`M-1`… binds) and **resize/SIGWINCH** working — see Terminal UI `#cockpit-browser`.
7. When changing shortcuts: update `shortcuts.py` **and** `keybindings.conf` together (host test enforces tokens).
8. After rootfs/Dockerfile UI changes: `orcan build` then recreate (`orcan down && orcan up`).
9. Update **EN + PL** docs (`guides/terminal-ui.md`, `guides/workflows.md`, CHANGELOG) when behaviour or paths change.
10. Run `make validate` and `make docs-check` before claiming done.
